@TicketApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### 1. List everything
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket

### 2. List tickets with High Priority
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket?priority=High

### 3. List tickets with Open Status
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket?status=Open

### 4. List tickets with Urgent Priority and Open Status
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket?priority=Urgent&status=Open

### 5. Get ticket with id 2
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/2

### 6. Get ticket that doesn't exist
GET {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/5000

### 7. Create new ticket (valid)
POST {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "A new ticket", "Description": "Very interesting ticket", "Priority": "High", "EstimatedHours": 4 }

### 8. Create new ticket (invalid)
POST {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "Test", "Description": "Very interesting ticket", "Priority": "High", "EstimatedHours": 4 }

### 9. Create new ticket (invalid)
POST {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "Longer", "Description": "Very interesting ticket", "Priority": "High", "EstimatedHours": 41 }

### 10. Update a ticket (valid)
PUT {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "Longer", "Description": "Very interesting ticket", "EstimatedHours": 35 }

### 11. Update a ticket (invalid)
PUT {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "Longer", "Description": "Very interesting ticket" }

### 12. Create a ticket to delete for 13
POST {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Title": "A new ticket", "Description": "Very interesting ticket", "Priority": "High", "EstimatedHours": 4 }

### 13. Delete a ticket (valid)
DELETE {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/7

### 14. Delete a ticket (invalid)
DELETE {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/8

### 15. Resolve a ticket (invalid)
POST {{TicketApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket/7/resolve
